      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is super annoying, btw, because you have to wait the 5+ minutes for the disk wipe again. Is there actually a good reason why we\u0027re removing all TPM spaces on CCD open? Could we maybe only remove spaces that aren\u0027t NV_PLATFORMCREATE or something like that? (I don\u0027t necessarily think it\u0027s \"right\" to erase the rollback counters there either, although in practice it tends to be harmless.)",
